ard, a Bronze Star veteran who won his party's nomination in August.\n\nThe race is rated a tossup by several analysts, though others call it a lean toward Democrats. The most recent polling, conducted in August by Democratic-leaning firms, showed a tied contest. Hines has strong outside support, including a $1 million Giffords PAC investment, while Bouchard holds a large cash-on-hand advantage. Prediction markets give Hines roughly a two-in-three chance of winning, making the seat a modest Democratic favorite with genuine Republican upside.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6628, "margin": 2.54}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.6491, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.6831, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.6477, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.623, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.5903, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.6399, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.6806, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.6694, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.7119, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.6799, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.6842, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.6979, "margin": 2.8}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.6212, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.6272, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.6412, "margin": 2.8}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.6477, "margin": 2.5}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.6501, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.6527, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.6567, "margin": 3.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.6632, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.6348, "margin": 2.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.6793, "margin": 3.0}]}